# Possibility Technician cast normally ({2}{R}: Ruby, Jet, Pearl). Its own entry exiles the top card of Bot1's library, an Island, which
# Bot1 may play as their land play (the Technician is a Kavu they control); Bot2's library is untouched. Bot1's Ornithopter (no Kavu)
# entering, and Bot2's Molecular Modifier (a Kavu Bot1 doesn't control) entering, trigger nothing. Then Bot1's own Molecular
# Modifier enters and the Technician triggers for it: the next card after the turn's draw, Mox Sapphire, is exiled and may be played.

